       locale - get locale‐specific information

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
       llooccaallee [_o_p_t_i_o_n]

       llooccaallee [_o_p_t_i_o_n] --aa

       llooccaallee [_o_p_t_i_o_n] --mm

